ls -la
# expected:
#   {{ manifest.zenoh.trial.vendor }}-cert.pem   ← present at handshake to the router
#   {{ manifest.zenoh.trial.vendor }}-key.pem    ← keep mode 0400
#   <ca-root>.pem                                ← trust anchor (per-goatnet filename; see NOTES.md)
#   first-publisher.py                           ← worked Python publisher (mTLS pre-wired)
#   <onboarding-guide>.md                        ← longer-form onboarding guide (per-goatnet filename)
#   NOTES.md                                     ← per-participant notes
