## Enforcement caveat (mesh L7 gating, as of 2026-05-16)

Any authenticated user currently reaches every OIDC-gated service URL on the mesh — L7 group-claim gating is not yet enforced. Your group labels are correct for future enforcement but access is not yet restricted by them today.

